OL,3,AUK and Germany will face threats
OL,4,Atogether, says Burnham in Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and Germany will face threats
OL,7,Ftogether, Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fhas said as he reaffirmed a series of
OL,9,Fdefence and security partnerships.
OL,11,FOn his first official European trip,
OL,12,Fapart from visits to Ukraine, Burnham
OL,13,Fmet German Chancellor Friedrich Merz,
OL,14,Fand was greeted with military honours
OL,15,Fin Berlin.
OL,17,FSpeaking to reporters at the German
OL,18,Fcapital's Federal Chancellery, the
OL,19,Fprime minister said both countries were
OL,20,Ffacing hybrid attacks "on a regular
OL,21,Fbasis" and "it makes sense" to take
OL,22,Fthem on together.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
