OL,3,AUK and Germany will face threats
OL,4,Atogether, says Burnham in Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair formally ratified the 2025
OL,7,FKensington Treaty, a partnership
OL,8,Fcommitting both countries to tackle
OL,9,Fhostile activity.
